# Build products of build-gfxstream.sh / run.sh. All reproducible from the scripts + the pinned
# third_party checkout; none of it is authored here.
#
# `lib64/` is staged by run.sh, not written by hand: it holds the KosmicKrisp ICD manifest plus an
# ABSOLUTE symlink to Homebrew's libvulkan.dylib. Committing it would bake one machine's Homebrew
# prefix into the repo. (ANDROID_EMU_VK_ICD confines gfxstream's loader search to this dir — see the
# comment at run.sh:29.)
probe
probe.dSYM/
lib64/

# `evidence/` is deliberately NOT ignored — the screenshots and capability dumps in it are the
# recorded proof behind the PHASE*-STATUS.md claims, and Phase 0.6 adds the identity goldens there.
